    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternity's Echo: Patient Zero</strong> takes place at a gas station in Winona, Arizona. Rayne Williams is a D.I.B Agent sent to investigate the strange occurrences at this gas station along Route 66. Join the story through Rayne's perspective as she tries to fulfill her mission amidst the challenges she encounters on the station's premises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dimensional Investigations Bureau (DIB)</strong> is a specialized agency operating under the United States government, dedicated to investigating paranormal, mysterious, and challenging-to-solve cases. DIB's purpose is to identify potential threats to humanity by examining enigmatic subjects like different dimensions, time travel, and supernatural beings and to provide solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960/extras/7c0caa96acbd552d8773129ad5ce29f1.poster.avif?t=1749401719\" width=630 height=1200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960/extras/7c0caa96acbd552d8773129ad5ce29f1.webm?t=1749401719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960/extras/7c0caa96acbd552d8773129ad5ce29f1.mp4?t=1749401719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternity's Echo: Patient Zero</strong> takes place at a gas station in Winona, Arizona. Rayne Williams is a D.I.B Agent sent to investigate the strange occurrences at this gas station along Route 66. Join the story through Rayne's perspective as she tries to fulfill her mission amidst the challenges she encounters on the station's premises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dimensional Investigations Bureau (DIB)</strong> is a specialized agency operating under the United States government, dedicated to investigating paranormal, mysterious, and challenging-to-solve cases. DIB's purpose is to identify potential threats to humanity by examining enigmatic subjects like different dimensions, time travel, and supernatural beings and to provide solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960/extras/7c0caa96acbd552d8773129ad5ce29f1.poster.avif?t=1749401719\" width=630 height=1200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960/extras/7c0caa96acbd552d8773129ad5ce29f1.webm?t=1749401719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688960/extras/7c0caa96acbd552d8773129ad5ce29f1.mp4?t=1749401719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
